            "sid": "JOB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aha izooba erindi abaana ba Ruhanga bakaija kwemurika ahari MUKAMA, na Sitaane yaabaijamu ngu nawe ayemurikye ahari MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaabuuza Sitaane ati: Nooruga hi? Sitaane yaamugarukamu ati: Ninduga kugyendagyenda omu nsi, n'okugizengyereramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 1:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagaruka yaabuuza Sitaane ati: Ebyo oyetegyereize omwiru wangye Yobu, ku hataine mushaija orikumushusha omu nsi, ku ataine kabara, kandi ku ahikiriire, omushaija orinkutiina akeetantara ekibi? Na mbwenu, n'obu oraabe wandeeteire kumukora kubi, n'okumucwekyereza nimmutura busha, kwonka akihamiire aha kuhikiirira kwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitaane yaamugarukamu ati: Amagara gakira amagana. Ebi omuntu atungire byona, akaabihayo ahaw'amagara ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka mbwenu gorora omukono gwawe, okore aha magufa ge n'aha mubiri gwe, naija kukwehakana butunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagira Sitaane ati: Reeba, ari omu bushoboorozi bwawe; kwonka otamwita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
