        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baamureebire bakiri hare, baamwebwa, baimutsya amaraka gaabo, baarira; baataagura ebijwaro byabo, baayeshuka eiju omu mutwe, kandi baarimiisha n'ahaiguru. ",
